cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LISFLOOD-FP × SWMM bidirectional coupling"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the upstream LISFLOOD-FP and SWMM works."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - name: FloodGroup
license: GPL-2.0-only
abstract: >
  Two-way coupling of the 2-D flood model LISFLOOD-FP (8.1.0, commit 637106b)
  with the 1-D sewer model EPA SWMM 5.1.015 in a single executable. The ACC and
  FV1 surface solvers are coupled on multi-core CPUs (OpenMP) and on NVIDIA GPUs
  (CUDA) with the same exchange law. Manholes exchange water in both directions
  through orifice (surcharge, submerged inflow) and weir (free inflow) laws, a
  new COUPLED outfall type discharges into finite-volume 2-D receiving cells,
  and SWMM node flooding is returned to the surface.
keywords:
  - flood
  - LISFLOOD-FP
  - SWMM
  - coupling
  - urban drainage
  - CPU
  - GPU
  - CUDA
